#: manual/api/deriv.md:82
msgid "`x: Double` — The point at which the derivative is evaluated."
msgstr "`x: Double` — 微分係数を評価する点。"

#: manual/api/deriv.md:14
#: manual/api/deriv.md:48
#: manual/api/deriv.md:83
msgid "`h: Double` — The initial step size for numerical differentiation, which will be adaptively adjusted if necessary."
msgstr "`h: Double` — 数値微分の初期ステップサイズ。必要に応じて適応的に調整されます。"

